<title>USA: Panaco resumes production at West Delta.</title>
<headline>Panaco resumes production at West Delta.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panaco Inc said Wednesday it has resumed production from its West Delta Fields drilling operation in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>The operation was shut down April 25 for repairs due to a fire.</p>
<p>Panaco is an independent oil and gas exploration and production company.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
